{
 "id": "business-english",
 "title": "Anglais professionnel : mails et réunions",
 "level": "B1",
 "topic": "Anglais pro",
 "summary": "Écrire un mail clair et poli, ouvrir/conclure, demander, refuser, et participer à une réunion.",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Structure d'un mail"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "**Objet** (*Subject*) : court et précis → *Meeting on Friday – agenda*.",
    "**Salutation** : *Dear Mr Smith,* / *Hi Anna,*.",
    "**Raison** : *I am writing to…* / *I'm getting in touch about…*",
    "**Corps** : un paragraphe par idée.",
    "**Conclusion** : *Please let me know if you have any questions.*",
    "**Formule finale** : *Best regards,* / *Kind regards,* / *Best,*."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Formules utiles"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "head": [
    "Situation",
    "Formule"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "Demander poliment",
     "Could you please send me…?"
    ],
    [
     "Joindre un fichier",
     "Please find attached…"
    ],
    [
     "Remercier",
     "Thank you for your quick reply."
    ],
    [
     "S'excuser",
     "I apologise for the delay."
    ],
    [
     "Relancer",
     "Just a quick reminder about…"
    ],
    [
     "Refuser poliment",
     "Unfortunately, I won't be able to…"
    ],
    [
     "Proposer un rendez-vous",
     "Would Tuesday at 10 suit you?"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "En réunion"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "head": [
    "Action",
    "Formule"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "Prendre la parole",
     "If I may, I'd like to add…"
    ],
    [
     "Être d'accord",
     "I totally agree. / That's a good point."
    ],
    [
     "Pas d'accord (poli)",
     "I see your point, but…"
    ],
    [
     "Demander de répéter",
     "Sorry, could you repeat that?"
    ],
    [
     "Clarifier",
     "Just to be clear, do you mean…?"
    ],
    [
     "Conclure",
     "To sum up… / Let's recap."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "tip",
   "text": "**Style** : en anglais pro, on préfère les formes **polies** (*Could you…?*, *I would appreciate…*) et on évite les ordres directs."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "Please find attached the report.",
   "fr": "Veuillez trouver le rapport ci-joint."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "I'm writing to confirm our meeting.",
   "fr": "Je vous écris pour confirmer notre réunion."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "Could you please send me the file?",
   "fr": "Pourriez-vous m'envoyer le fichier ?"
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "I look forward to hearing from you.",
   "fr": "J'attends votre réponse avec impatience."
  }
 ],
